Third-party software used at runtime and in the Docker image
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

opslens runs the following programs as separate processes, unmodified, and talks to them over a database
connection and an HTTP API. It does not link to them or include their source. Their source code is available at
the URLs below, at the version tags named in the Dockerfile.

  - Flowpipe               GNU AGPL-3.0   https://github.com/turbot/flowpipe
  - Steampipe              GNU AGPL-3.0   https://github.com/turbot/steampipe
  - Steampipe plugins      Apache-2.0     (see above)
